// std/paint/radiance.ts (gatherIrradiance + shadowVisibility) and materials.ts.
// Adaptation: deterministic sixteen-cone fragment gather, not the upstream temporal
// compute/denoise pass. Twelve march/shadow steps, two lights, a 28-pixel spill
// radius inside FFrames' cached 32-pixel field. Shape alpha/normals come from the
// actual loaded font. Optional light orbit is a caption-time addition.

